      {
        "author_name": "Catherine",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113821927573199444923/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJIIIhfxAqmYr7gks5WQ2Lqky1AfPaWOKwIpLNAx9o2tqepxQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Storing my car for the winter was an easy process. Chantel took care of everything which made me a happy camper. Costs are reasonable.  I highly recommend Depotium for storage.",
        "time": 1764774463,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Roderick MacKenzie",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107917989866314380517/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLP-f29Mcswwrpri5_RzprgYXSulO2ctPZ9t8v1UfasIyPO8Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Well received with helpful information for our needs. Polite service and easy instructions to follow. Will use their services again if the occasion arises.",
        "time": 1768588835,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Charlene Lynch",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102102196801739399764/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJkHl4kCmu4rDva_R3L-xNfm-lwPk_0vr8G09F8t4d2IKLSNQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Exceptional service and clarity upon reserving a storage unit over the phone. Chantal is the one that greets you at the front desk. She is by far the kindest most sincere person I have ever met. The storage unit is clean, spacious and well secured. I highly recommend this company.",
        "time": 1744898397,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Aline Hagerimana",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101476034751593303776/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKDUk9s2UoVQb_2SRPvndInTnTbSIyDRT0DMI_an1vjGltldw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Everything was good until yesterday at noon ( December 22nd) where I spent more than 2 hours waiting for customer service to try to contact the manager and get the gate door open.\nAfter several calls to a French speaking & English speaking agent, I gave up and left without being able to get in.\nSeveral other clients were there, tried their code  & door didn’t open! It is disappointing",
        "time": 1735683546,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "John Humchack",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107445501619220045837/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKLFzzkTULN6i4K0ibXwk8xL4bkWCRaU_pxsFXysrREUuGheg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "It is without a doubt that I would highly recommend West Island Movers to anyone within listening distance for any project they may have before them. Anymore large or small is not beyond these professional’s capabilities. They approach all jobs with their highest levels of expertise courteous and cordial  and professional are the cornerstones of their work ethic. Thanks to the team. I don’t know what I’d have done without you. You guys are the best!!!",
        "time": 1671229156,
        "translated": false
      }
